								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=895"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1395.msg14037#msg14037"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1395.msg14037#msg14037">Re: Ascent breaking up?</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #41 on:</b> January 29, 2005, 03:25:34 am &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							Since all you ascent dick sucking fags won&#039;t say anything, I will.&nbsp; I always hated ascent and am glad they finally broke up.&nbsp; Atleast when I used to hate em back in the day they were a force to be reckoned with, and a guild I respected.&nbsp; &nbsp;The people who rode the guild out to the end really soiled the legacy of ascent with their dickless deeds, and It&#039;s a blessing to the old school that the guild is gone before it earned reputation gets dredged through any more shit. <br /><br />Three cheers that they are gone, and I hope none of the actually respectful guilds on the server take any of the sorry ass fags who bailed on their guilds for greener pastures.&nbsp; <br /><br />Fuck ascent,<br /><br />Mgram
						</td>
					</tr>
