							<div class="quoteheader"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1395.msg14037#msg14037">Quote from: Mgram on January 29, 2005, 03:25:34 am</a></div><div class="quote">I always hated ascent and am glad they finally broke up.</div>Guess you missed the point made, that more of the Ascent core that killed shit like Ssra Emp is playing under the &lt;Ascent&gt; tag than have been in years. The guild is doing just fine, just no longer on RN. Then again it seems like Medivh is the new RN, with so many people coming in to even the alliance side (Kinladar etc).<br /><br /><br /><div class="quoteheader">Quote</div><div class="quote">Atleast when I used to hate em back in the day they were a force to be reckoned with, and a guild I respected.</div>I&#039;m curious why anyone would have hated us back in the day. Only ones we were mean to were Arirang and AoD/AL, and later on DA/EiE to some degree (mostly the Emp cockblock). 
