							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							So that is what is happening RN is slowly dieing and everyone is transfering to another server.&nbsp; 8(&nbsp; &nbsp;I liked alot of people in Ascent and (including Rogosh)&nbsp; I loved his attitude.&nbsp; I know I am the only one that did I found it fuinny.&nbsp; Ascent did have some dickless people but I think what people forget to realize is that Ascent was No 1 for a long time.&nbsp; They did stuff first and it siffed down to the other guilds and they proceeded faster.&nbsp; That is just my opinion. My favorite former members of Ascent that I am truely going to miss is Korban, Cartier, Karadana, Koradur, Grem cause he is truely a nice prick, Rogosh cause we were in the same guild at one time and I loved his attitude, (even though I didnt know him well but respected him alot is HONCH)&nbsp; He was a great leader!!!&nbsp; Anway there are many fine players in Ascent but with other guilds now popping up it is there time to SHINE.<br /><br />Good luck to Ascent <br /><br />Colleen Quickness<br /><br /> <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/approve.gif" alt="approve" border="0" />
						</td>
